---
description: Field-level input trimming on DTOs
alwaysApply: true
---

# Input trimming

- Trim string inputs with `@Trim()` from `@common/decorators/trim.decorator` on DTO properties (`body`, `query`).
- Requires `ValidationPipe({ transform: true })` (already global in `main.ts`).
- Do not use global trim middleware/interceptors; do not call `.trim()` in controllers or services.
- Apply `@Trim()` to every new string field on request DTOs; assume trimmed values in business logic.
